   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Premises declared to be protected places"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The premises described in the second column of the Schedule are declared to be protected places for the purposes of the Act, and each person specified in the first column of that Schedule is designated as the authority of the corresponding protected place."
   }
